---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor withdraws excess
    q_check_paused --> q_check_published: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_published --> q_check_not_claimed: acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot is set
    q_check_published --> q_revert_not_published: accepted capital not published
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_verify_merkle: position.hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_not_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: excess already claimed
    q_verify_merkle --> q_calc_excess: verifyProof(acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot, leaf(investor, acceptedAmount))
    q_verify_merkle --> q_revert_proof: invalid Merkle proof
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_excess: excessAmount = position.investedCapital - acceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_update: excessAmount > 0
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_no_excess: no excess to withdraw
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, excessAmount), emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(investor, excessAmount)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_not_published --> [*]: revert AcceptedCapitalNotPublished
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcess

    note right of q_calc_excess
        INV-001: excessAmount = investedCapital - acceptedAmount (never negative due to Merkle verification)
        INV-002: Each investor claims excess exactly once
        INV-003: acceptedAmount <= position.investedCapital guaranteed by Merkle tree construction
    end note
